t Medicine Wait list-1  \n16 Tuhin Subhra Panda 06/26/1995 UR Chest Medicine Wait list-2  \n17 Aniket Goswami 7/16/1997 UR Dermatology Wait list-1  \n18 Stuti Agrawal 03/20/1999 UR Dermatology Wait list-2  \n19 Paridhi Vaidh 05/20/1999 UR Dermatology Wait list-3  \n \nNote:   The departments in which the vacancy advertised against advt. no. 09 of 2026 dt. 06.10.2026 but no candidate appeared for interview \nor did not qualified even single candidate or the result is kept in abeyance due to administrative reason(s) have not been shown in the above \nselection list. \n \nTerms and conditions: \n1.  The selection of the above candidates are provisional subject to verification of their original certificates in support of their \nqualification, age, community/caste, updates registration and experience as claimed, NOC etc. upto the satisfaction of the appointing \nauthority.  \n2. While every care has been taken in preparing the result, however the competent authority reserves the right to rectify \nerrors/omissions and even cancellation of result at later stage. \n3. Offer of engagement will be sent to selected candidates in due course of time by email.  \n \n \n \n        Dean (In-charge) \nESI-PGIMSR, ESIC Medical College & Hospital and ODC(EZ),  \nJoka, Kolkata-700104 \n412(Dean-Joka).A.12/16/Cont.Recrut/2022/Recrut.Cell/Vol-II I/4614985/2026", "doc_status": "text"}]}, {"source": {"id": "epfo", "name": "EPFO", "kind": "watch", "url": "https://www.epfindia.gov.in/", "state": "IN", "district": null, "group": "central", "category": "careers", "filter_jobs": true, "selector": null, "sections": null, "enabled": true, "runner": "local", "churn_limit": 25, "region_filter": false, "render": false, "every_hours": 0, "digest": true, "alert_on": null, "use_base": false}, "status": "ok", "error": null, "items": []}, {"source": {"id": "navodaya-vidyalaya-samiti", "name": "Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti", "kind": "watch", "url": "https://navodaya.gov.in/", "state": "IN", "district": nul